---
import TalkToUsSection from '../../components/TalkToUsSection.astro';
import Specimen from '../Specimen.astro';
---
<Specimen title="Closing call to action" surface="none" padding="none" code={'<TalkToUsSection />\n<TalkToUsSection alternate />   /* on the grey band */\n<TalkToUsSection contactHref="/Contact?reason=consulting" />'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>The last thing on most pages, flat in its band: the invitation and two actions on the left, the glass envelope on the right. Set <code>alternate</code> when the section before it is plain, so the bands keep alternating, and <code>contactHref</code> to open a prefilled contact form.</p></Fragment>
    <TalkToUsSection />
</Specimen>
